  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signal processing functionality and performance of an IP-to-IP voice gateway optimized for the transport of voice and voiceband data</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signal processing functionality and performance of an IP-to-IP voice gateway optimized for the transport of voice and voiceband data</title>
